# dalli 3.2.8
# Memcached command injection through numeric arguments to incr/decr and
# fetch_with_lock. Fixed in ~> 3.2.9 / 4.3.4 / 5.0.7 / >= 5.1.1, but the image
# ships 3.2.8 from the pinned Gemfile.lock -- same "can't move the gem without
# re-resolving OBS's lockfile" premise as the rest of this file.
